  "from": "2022-01",
  "commemorates": "Delta as official airline of Team USA (first for Beijing 2022).",
  "description": "Fuselage: white, with sweeps rising from the belly behind the nose: a mid-blue band and a broad sky-light-blue one sweeping up over the wing to the crown aft of it; a red field on the lower aft fuselage over a navy belly. Titles: huge navy 'TEAM USA' across the windows over the wing; 'DELTA' with the widget forward, a US flag and 'OFFICIAL AIRLINE' with the Olympic rings below it. Aft, ahead of the stabilizer, the Team USA emblem: stars over two red chevrons. Tail: Delta's standard navy fin with the red widget. Engines navy.",
